Package: LatentComBat
Type: Package
Title: Latent-Aware Batch Harmonization
Version: 0.0.0.9001
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Authors@R: person("Zheng", "Ren", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "zren1422@gmail.com")
Author: Zheng Ren [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Zheng Ren <zren1422@gmail.com>
Description: Tools for harmonizing high-dimensional data across observed batch
    effects while accounting for latent technical variation. The package
    includes a sequential surrogate-variable plus ComBat workflow and a joint
    Bayesian latent ComBat workflow, with optional protected biological
    covariate spaces, latent variance stabilization, and optional uncertainty-
    aware post-harmonization inference via Bayesian posterior propagation or a
    full-pipeline bootstrap for the sequential workflow.
